WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:17.880
I was supposed to be sent away
But they forgot to come and get me&nbsp;

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:28.800
I was a functioning alcoholic
Til nobody noticed my new aesthetic&nbsp;

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.160
All of this to say
I hope you’re okay&nbsp;

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:42.200
But you’re the reason
And no one here’s to blame&nbsp;

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.520
But what about your quiet treason?

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:51.120
And for a fortnight there
We were forever&nbsp;

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:56.120
Run into you sometimes
Ask about the weather&nbsp;

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:01.160
Now you’re in my backyard
Turned into good neighbors&nbsp;

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:15.520
Your wife waters flowers
I want to kill her.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:25.280
